{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716600/extras/about.png?t=1750165817\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your side  in a <strong>4v4 voice controlled battle</strong>\u00a0between the sorcerers and warlocks. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716600/extras/fireballGif.gif?t=1750165817\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Channel your voice to cast fireballs, shoot frostbolts, conjure wormholes, and fire arcane blasts to vanquish your foes by speaking the correct words.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716600/extras/objective.png?t=1750165817\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For thousands of years sorcerers and warlocks have waged war for the title of supremacy in the arcane arts. Now, it is your turn to enter the fray. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Overseen by The Goblin Archmagus, this battle will take place inside of the Mage Arena. The Mage Arena is an ever changing island, filled with fantastical landscapes to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716600/extras/zones.gif?t=1750165817\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Utilize the resources of the land to craft useful items to gain an edge over your opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In order to claim victory, you must infiltrate your opponents base and capture their flag pole. Once captured the Goblin Archmagus will deem them unworthy of resurrection, meaning once you eliminate each member of the opposing team, victory is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716600/extras/flagdemo.gif?t=1750165817\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3716600?t=1750165817","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716600/576b02ee4e69f74e354a8b5ff20c39d9221b1527/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750165817","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716600/54dd4bd8386d010d2d8997707c00b5369c0a2344/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750165817","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716600/54dd4bd8386d010d2d8997707c00b5369c0a2344/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750165817","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Player characters can die and kill other player characters through various means. "},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716600/extras/about.png?t=1750165817\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your side  in a <strong>4v4 voice controlled battle</strong>\u00a0between the sorcerers and warlocks. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716600/extras/fireballGif.gif?t=1750165817\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Channel your voice to cast fireballs, shoot frostbolts, conjure wormholes, and fire arcane blasts to vanquish your foes by speaking the correct words.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716600/extras/objective.png?t=1750165817\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For thousands of years sorcerers and warlocks have waged war for the title of supremacy in the arcane arts. Now, it is your turn to enter the fray. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Overseen by The Goblin Archmagus, this battle will take place inside of the Mage Arena. The Mage Arena is an ever changing island, filled with fantastical landscapes to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716600/extras/zones.gif?t=1750165817\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Utilize the resources of the land to craft useful items to gain an edge over your opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In order to claim victory, you must infiltrate your opponents base and capture their flag pole. Once captured the Goblin Archmagus will deem them unworthy of resurrection, meaning once you eliminate each member of the opposing team, victory is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716600/extras/flagdemo.gif?t=1750165817\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>","developers":["jrsjams"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716600/e09e178465c67642c1214736e29d64846d966e52/header.jpg?t=1750165817","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257157825,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257157825/movie480.mp4?t=1750165815","max":"http://video.akamai.